# Check L17's ignore rules, as Docker reads them (contracts/cli.md, CL2).
# A line that starts with # is a comment.
# A folder, and an exception for one file inside it.
logs
!logs/keep.log
# The files of a folder, not the folder itself.
cache/*
# At any depth.
**/*.tmp
**/node_modules
# A leading slash is dropped: this names the top only.
/top-only.txt
# Trailing spaces are trimmed.
notes.txt   
# An escaped hash, and a hash after a space, are names.
\#hash.txt
 #spaced.txt
# Names the repository keeps out of a commit, written at run time.
.env*
build
!build/keep.txt
dist/
